# Cache is machine-local.
#
# IN A PROJECT USING EVALGATE, commit .evalgate/history.jsonl (the drift time
# series is the point and can't be reconstructed after the fact) and
# .evalgate/calibration.json (it records that the judge was measured, and CI
# reads it to publish agreement without re-running calibration).
#
# THIS repo is evalgate's own, where both files are just leftovers from
# `npm run example` — so they're ignored here and only here.
